    <solution><alert> Solution:</alert> 



This is a midpoint Riemann sum.  Its value is:
<me>f(1.3) \cdot 0.6 + 
  f(1.9) \cdot 0.6 + 
  f(2.5) \cdot 0.6 + 
  f(3.1) \cdot 0.6 + 
  f(3.7) \cdot 0.6</me>
<me>= \left( 2.46228882668983 + 3.73213196614723 + 5.65685424949238 + 8.57418770029035 + 12.9960383416998 \right)
  \cdot 0.6</me>
<me>= 20.0529.</me>





